We have received the most awesome feedback lately...thank you so much to those of you that go out of your way to share you appreciation for what we do, it makes all the difference in our world!

_"Heya Bec! I would like to say, that your rhythmculture troop, and drum classes and just everything, are the most professionally run, african group, that I have had anything to do with!_ 

_Really enjoyed looking at the pics of the Ocean St performance, and the girls looked stunning, and danced like demons!!_

_Awesome work! So happy to be able to be an itty bitty part of it, as a student!"_ \- Chris

[![rc banner](/media/2014/05/rc-banner-1.jpg)](/media/2014/05/rc-banner-1.jpg) [![rc banner 3](/media/2014/05/rc-banner-3-1.jpg)](/media/2014/05/rc-banner-3-1.jpg)

_"I really enjoyed the dance class tonight guys. It was full of dancing._ _I loved doing the full dances without stopping. It was a great workout, I found it easier to pick up the dance routine as a whole, and it was a lot of fun. Great drumming too. Thanks for providing such a great class without the huge expense." -_ Wendy
